Let $X$ be the event of getting spade $\begin{aligned}& P(X=0)=\frac{39}{52} \times \frac{39}{52}=\frac{9}{16}\\
& P(X=1)=\frac{13}{52} \times \frac{39}{52}=\frac{3}{16}\\
& P(X=2)=\frac{13}{52} \times \frac{13}{52}=\frac{1}{16}
